        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 25:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi achimuamba mkpwaza-mwanawe, “Mwenyezi Mlungu naamjaliye mana karichire kuhendera manono ario moyo na ariofwa.” Na achienjereza kuamba, “Mutu hiye ni mʼbari wehu tsona ni mʼbari wa phephi anayeweza kuhukombola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Ruthi Mmoabu achienjereza kuamba, “Tsona akaniambira nienderere kutsembwesa phephi na ahendie a kazi hadi amale kuvuna chila chitu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi achimjibu achiamba, “Indakala vinono mwanangu ichikala undahenda kazi na ahendi a kazi achetu ario mundani mwa Boazi kpwa kukala uchiphiya mundani kpwa mutu wanjina undahendwa vibaya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
